"description":"The new super educational application, kind of learning alphabet games!\n    \n    It is  suitable for toddlers aged  from 2 till 4. Kids like to collect puzzles at that age. So the idea to combine ABC and picture-puzzles is simple but it is has the capacity to capture the child and help him not only to memorize the alphabet but also to develop attentiveness, assiduity and logical thinking.\n    The game is comprised of 26 cards for the number of English alphabet’s letters and 10 additional cards with figures. A  lovely locomotive with a wagon-letter appear at the begging of each card and then the child have to drag a picture on a fitting puzzle. The classical ABC principle is that each word should start from the respective letter. The funny little letters arise after successful completeness of four cards. Catch them all!\n    The game is carried out in bright but calm colors with pleasant melodies and voice pronouncing and lovely pictures. Let your child learn with pleasure!", "userRatingCount":58639}]
